# agent working files
.hermes/

# Local secrets. `crates/support/.env` holds the Boundless RPC URL, wallet key and Pinata JWT that
# `boundless_prove_inner` reads from the environment. Committing one publishes a funded key.
# The agent permission files deny reads of these paths, but a denied read does not stop `git add`,
# so the per-environment variants are ignored here too.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
